A way to make searching less boring is to use an item which has 
intrinsic searching.  For lawful characters, the easiest item to
obtain is Excalibur (via dipping a long sword for a level 5+ character).
Just wield it and walk around, traps and hidden doors reveal themselves
as you walk by.  What fun!  I don't know which other items have this
capability, can anyone add to the list?

